    summary_en: "Work with decimal numbers, precision and formatted output.",
    summary_bn: "দশমিক সংখ্যা, Precision আর ফরম্যাট করা আউটপুট নিয়ে কাজ।",
    objectives_en: ["Choose between float and double", "Control decimal places with %.nf", "Avoid integer division mistakes"],
